sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CLI as pr-review CLI
    participant Git as Git/AWS
    participant Art as Artifact Store<br/>~/.pr-review/reports/...
    participant AI as AI Tool<br/>Copilot/Codex
    participant Session as session.rs

    Dev->>CLI: pr-review pr 4663 --ai codex

    CLI->>Git: Fetch PR metadata + branches
    Git-->>CLI: source, target, repo metadata

    CLI->>Git: Generate diff
    Git-->>CLI: full diff

    CLI->>CLI: Build initial review prompt<br/>full prompt + full diff
    CLI->>AI: Run initial review
    AI-->>CLI: review result

    CLI->>Art: Save diff, prompt, review.md, meta.json

    CLI->>Session: prepare_session_artifacts()
    Session->>Art: Split diff into diff-by-file/*.patch
    Session->>AI: Summarize review.md
    AI-->>Session: compact review summary
    Session->>Art: Save review-summary.md

    CLI->>Session: run_interactive_session()

    loop User asks follow-up questions
        Dev->>Session: Ask question
        Session->>Art: Read review-summary.md
        Session->>Art: Read conversation-summary.md
        Session->>Art: Select relevant diff-by-file/*.patch
        Session->>AI: Small chat prompt<br/>summary + selected diff + question
        AI-->>Session: answer
        Session->>Art: Append to conversation.md
        Session-->>Dev: Show answer
    end

    alt User types /full
        Session->>AI: Send full diff once
    end

    Dev->>Session: /exit
    Session->>AI: Update compact conversation summary once if conversation changed
    AI-->>Session: updated summary
    Session->>Art: Save conversation-summary.md
    Session-->>Dev: Conversation saved
